li>
<li>=E2=80=9CNumbers=E2=80=9D or =E2=80=9Cnumbers on the number line=E2=80=
=9D refers to the numbers from 1 to sum(weights).</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Determining which numbers on the number line correspond to which=
 indexes</strong><br>
As mentioned before, to know which index to return, we need a way to tell w=
